sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Kafka
    participant C as consumer
    participant R as Redis
    K->>C: OrderConfirmed e1: TENT, STOVE, MUG
    C->>R: EVALSHA record(seen:e1, also:TENT, also:STOVE, also:MUG)
    Note over R: SET seen:e1 NX ok → 6 × ZINCRBY, trim each to 200
    R-->>C: 1 (counted)
    C->>K: commit offset
    K->>C: OrderConfirmed e1 (again)
    C->>R: EVALSHA record(…)
    Note over R: SET seen:e1 NX fails → nothing else runs
    R-->>C: 0 (duplicate)
    C->>K: commit offset
